    /(?<![\d,])\b(?:(at most|no more than|up to|under|less than|at least|no fewer than|over|more than|exactly|about|around|roughly|between)\s+)?(\d{1,3}(?:,\d{3})+|\d{1,7})(?:\s*(?:[–—-]|and)\s*(\d{1,3}(?:,\d{3})+|\d{1,7}))?\s+words?\b/gi;
